msgid "Change Terminal Title"
msgstr "更改终端标题"

msgid "Leave blank to restore the default title."
msgstr "留空以重置至默认标题。"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "确认"

msgid "Configuration Errors"
msgstr "配置错误"

msgid ""
"One or more configuration errors were found. Please review the errors below, "
"and either reload your configuration or ignore these errors."
msgstr ""
"加载配置时发现了以下错误。请仔细阅读错误信息，并选择忽略或重新加载配置文件。"

msgid "Ignore"
msgstr "忽略"

msgid "Reload Configuration"
msgstr "重新加载配置"

msgid "Split Up"
msgstr "向上分屏"

msgid "Split Down"
msgstr "向下分屏"

msgid "Split Left"
msgstr "向左分屏"

msgid "Split Right"
msgstr "向右分屏"

msgid "Execute a command…"
msgstr "选择要执行的命令……"

msgid "Copy"
msgstr "复制"

msgid "Paste"
msgstr "粘贴"

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "清除屏幕"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置终端"

msgid "Split"
msgstr "分屏"

msgid "Change Title…"
msgstr "更改标题……"

msgid "Tab"
msgstr "标签页"

msgid "New Tab"
msgstr "新建标签页"

msgid "Close Tab"
msgstr "关闭标签页"

msgid "Window"
msgstr "窗口"

msgid "New Window"
msgstr "新建窗口"

msgid "Close Window"
msgstr "关闭窗口"

msgid "Config"
msgstr "配置"

msgid "Open Configuration"
msgstr "打开配置文件"

msgid "Command Palette"
msgstr "命令面板"

msgid "Terminal Inspector"
msgstr "终端调试器"

msgid "About Witty"
msgstr "关于 Witty"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "退出"

msgid "Authorize Clipboard Access"
msgstr "剪贴板访问授权"

msgid ""
"An application is attempting to read from the clipboard. The current "
"clipboard contents are shown below."
msgstr "一个应用正在试图从剪贴板读取内容。剪贴板目前的内容如下："

msgid "Deny"
msgstr "拒绝"

msgid "Allow"
msgstr "允许"

msgid "Remember choice for this split"
msgstr "为本分屏记住当前选择"

msgid "Reload configuration to show this prompt again"
msgstr "本提示将在重载配置后再次出现"

msgid ""
"An application is attempting to write to the clipboard. The current "
"clipboard contents are shown below."
msgstr "一个应用正在试图向剪贴板写入内容。剪贴板目前的内容如下："

msgid "Warning: Potentially Unsafe Paste"
msgstr "警告：粘贴内容可能不安全"

msgid ""
"Pasting this text into the terminal may be dangerous as it looks like some "
"commands may be executed."
msgstr "将以下内容粘贴至终端内将可能执行有害命令。"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "关闭"

msgid "Quit Witty?"
msgstr "退出 Witty 吗？"

msgid "Close Window?"
msgstr "关闭窗口吗？"

msgid "Close Tab?"
msgstr "关闭标签页吗？"

msgid "Close Split?"
msgstr "关闭分屏吗？"

msgid "All terminal sessions will be terminated."
msgstr "终端内所有运行中的进程将被终止。"

msgid "All terminal sessions in this window will be terminated."
msgstr "窗口内所有运行中的进程将被终止。"

msgid "All terminal sessions in this tab will be terminated."
msgstr "标签页内所有运行中的进程将被终止。"

msgid "The currently running process in this split will be terminated."
msgstr "分屏内正在运行中的进程将被终止。"

msgid "Copied to clipboard"
msgstr "已复制至剪贴板"

msgid "Cleared clipboard"
msgstr "已清空剪贴板"

msgid "Command Succeeded"
msgstr "命令执行成功"

msgid "Command Failed"
msgstr "命令执行失败"

msgid "Main Menu"
msgstr "主菜单"

msgid "View Open Tabs"
msgstr "浏览标签页"

msgid "New Split"
msgstr "新建分屏"

msgid ""
"⚠️ You're running a debug build of Witty! Performance will be degraded."
msgstr "⚠️ Witty 正在以调试模式运行！性能将大打折扣。"

msgid "Reloaded the configuration"
msgstr "已重新加载配置"

msgid "Witty Developers"
msgstr "Witty 开发团队"

msgid "Witty: Terminal Inspector"
msgstr "Witty 终端调试器"
